        "# Attached thread state\n",
        "\n",
        "An attached thread state is a thread state associated with the current thread. A thread generally needs one to access Python objects through the C API.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-attached-thread-state)"
      ]
    }
